[statement]
A condition's entry whose operator admits earlier versions is met by a
package providing its name at no version: `x`'s condition is `v<3`, and
`a`, installed, provides `v` at no version, so `x` is installed too.

[repository]
P:x
V:1
i:v<3

P:a
V:1
p:v

[request]
a

[answer apk-tools 3.0.9-r0]
install a 1
install x 1
